+<tr bgcolor="#ffc8d8"><td rowspan=2><tt>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></td>
+<td colspan=2><tt>Collects&nbsp;multiple&nbsp;metrics&nbsp;based&nbsp;on&nbsp;their&nbsp;interaction&nbsp;records.<br>
+&nbsp;<br>
